        "cooked": "<p>In honour of Canadian Independence Day, Citizen Dawn has brought her daughter and friends to the of Atlantis to celebrate.</p>\n<p>Citizen Dawn vs Dark Watch Expatriette,&nbsp;Dark Watch Setback,&nbsp;Dark Watch Harpy&nbsp;Dark Watch Mister Fixer and&nbsp;Dark Watch NightMist in the Ruins.</p>\n<p>The &nbsp;Auroras are near the&nbsp;bottom of the deck, so don’t worry too much about those. Worry about the krakens and falling rocks killing the Citizens just when she’s going to flip back.</p>",
