        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/g/51bf81/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2019-10-20T14:38:15.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Lucked out with a mint. &nbsp;Expat went down fairly early, but her incap let me take out ongoings. &nbsp;Setback went down around the time that Devastating Aurora arrived, but the two incaps let Fixer pound Dawn. &nbsp;Harpy took one for the team with Lash of the Elements to put Dawn low enough for Fixer to finish. &nbsp;0/0/0/9/9, not fun.</p>",
